#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableMenuGen)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:161
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid "This will enable automatic regeneration of Windows' Start menu entries for KDE applications"
msgstr "Dit maakt dat automaatsche Wedderherstellen vun Windows sien Startmenü-Indrääg för KDE-Programmen an"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableMenuGen)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:167
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid "This option defines if Windows' Start menu entries should be regenerated or not. By default start menu entries are regenerated automaticaly, but you may wish to disable it if you have issues with that."
msgstr "Gifft an, wat Windows sien Startmenüindrääg wedderherstellt warrt oder nich. Standardwies warrt de Indrääg wedderherstellt, man Du kannst dat ok utmaken, wenn Du dor Problemen mit hest."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableMenuGen)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:170
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Enable automatic regeneration of start menu entries"
msgstr "Startmenü-Indrääg automaatsch nieg opstellen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableMenuGen)
#. +> stable
#: platform.ui:136
msgid "Enable automatic regeneration of start menu entries"
msgstr "Startmenü-Indrääg automaatsch nieg opstellen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkUseNativeDialogs)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:177
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid "Use native Windows file dialogs instead of KDE ones"
msgstr "Windows sien normaal Dateidialogen ansteed de vun KDE bruken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkUseNativeDialogs)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:183
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid "Choose this option to make KDE applications use usual Windows Open/Save file dialogs instead of custom KDE ones."
msgstr "Maak dat an, wenn Du dat wullt, KDE-Programmen bruukt bi't Opmaken un Sekern de normalen Windows-Dateidialogen ansteed de vun KDE."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkUseNativeDialogs)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:186
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Use native system file dialogs"
msgstr "Dat Systeem sien normaal Dateidialogen bruken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkUseNativeDialogs)
#. +> stable
#: platform.ui:143
msgid "Use native system file dialogs"
msgstr "Dat Systeem sien normaal Dateidialogen bruken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCPl)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:199
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid "Install SystemSettings into Windows' Control Panel"
msgstr "De Systeeminstellen na Windows sien Kuntrullpaneel installieren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCPl)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:202
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid ""
"This will install KDE SystemSettings as an element in Windows Control Panel.<br>"
"<b>This option tweaks your Windows registry!</b>"
msgstr ""
"Installeert de KDE-Systeeminstellen as en Element binnen dat Windows-Kuuntrullpaneel<br>"
"<b>Disse Optschoon passt Dien Windows-Registry to!</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCPl)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:205
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Install as control panel element"
msgstr "As Element vun't Kuntrullpaneel installeren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCPl)
#. +> stable
#: platform.ui:156
msgid "Install as control panel element"
msgstr "As Element vun't Kuntrullpaneel installeren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCursors)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:212
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid "Install Oxygen cursors and as Windows cursor schemes"
msgstr "Oxygen-Blinkers installeren un as Windows-Blinkerschemas bruken."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCursors)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:215
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid ""
"This will install Oxygen cursors into your system and combine them into cursor themes.<br>"
"<b>This option tweaks your Windows registry!</b>"
msgstr ""
"Dit installeert Oxygen-Blinkers op Dien Systeem un koppelt se as Blinkermustern tosamen.<br>"
"<b>Disse Optschoon passt Dien Windows-Registry to.</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCursors)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:218
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Install Oxygen cursor schemes"
msgstr "Oxygen-Blinkerschemas installeren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCursors)
#. +> stable
#: platform.ui:163
msgid "Install Oxygen cursor schemes"
msgstr "Oxygen-Blinkerschemas installeren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallWallpapers)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:225
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid "This option installs KDE wallpapers into your \"My Pictures\" directory"
msgstr "Installert KDE-Achtergrundbiller binnen Dien \"Egen Biller\"-Orner"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallWallpapers)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:228
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid ""
"This will install KDE wallpapers into <i>\"My Pictures\"</i> directory so that you could use them as your Windows wallpapers. If the checkbox is set to half-checked then it means that there're new wallpapers available to update.<br>"
" Wallpaper aspect ratio will be selected according to your current screen resolution."
msgstr ""
"Disse Akschoon installeert KDE-Achtergrundbiller binnen Dien <i>Egen Biller</i>-Orner, Du kannst se denn as Windows-Achtergrundbiller bruken. Is dat Krüüzfeld \"halvig\" ankrüüzt, gifft dat opfrischt Achtergrund-Biller.<br>"
" De Proportschoon vun de Achtergrundbiller warrt na Dien aktuelle Schirmoplösen fastleggt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallWallpapers)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:231
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Install Oxygen wallpapers"
msgstr "Oxygen-Achtergrundbiller installeren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallWallpapers)
#. +> stable
#: platform.ui:170
msgid "Install Oxygen wallpapers"
msgstr "Oxygen-Achtergrundbiller installeren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkStartAtLogin)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:238
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid "This will make essential KDE processes run at user login"
msgstr "Disse Optschoon föhrt de wichtigsten KDE-Perzessen bi't Anmellen ut"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkStartAtLogin)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:241
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will make needed KDE processes be started at user login. Normally these processes are started at when you start first KDE application during user session, so actual application launch is delayed.<br>"
"It is recommended to enable this option to make your applications launch faster for the first time.<br>"
"<b>This option tweaks your Windows registry!</b>"
msgstr ""
"Maakst Du dit an, warrt de nödigen KDE-Perzessen bi't Anmellen opropen. Normalerwies warrt disse Perzessen opropen, wenn Du dat eerste KDE-Programm binnen Dien Törn utföhrst, man denn töövt dat Programm eerst op disse Perzessen.<br>"
"Wullt Du dat eerste Programm gauer starten, maak disse Optschoon man an.<br>"
"<b>Disse Optschoon ännert Dien Windows-Registry!</b>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkStartAtLogin)
#. +> trunk
#: platform.ui:244
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Load KDE at user login"
msgstr "KDE bi't Anmellen starten"

